[{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0586","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0586.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1434","title":"Kerio MailServer Web Mail 跨站脚本漏洞","description":"Kerio MailServer 5.0 和 5.1 的 Web Mail 模块存在多个跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过构造包含恶意 HTML/JavaScript 代码的特制 URL，诱使已登录 Web Mail 的用户点击该链接，从而在受害者浏览器中以其他用户身份执行脚本。该漏洞影响 Kerio MailServer 5.0/5.1/5.1.1 的 Web Mail 功能，攻击者利用此漏洞可窃取用户会话 Cookie、劫持账户权限或篡改邮件内容，对邮件系统数据安全构成严重威胁。攻击者无需预先获取账户凭据，仅需发送恶意链接诱导用户点击即可实现攻击，利用门槛较低且影响范围较广。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.8,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1434"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2003-04-11T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:19Z","remediation":"将 Kerio MailServer 升级至 6.0 或更高版本（该版本对 Web Mail 模块输入参数进行了 HTML 特殊字符过滤与输出编码修复）。如暂时无法升级，应在 Web Mail 前端部署反向代理（如 Apache 或 Nginx），对 URL 参数中的 script、alert 等关键词进行拦截过滤，同时禁用 Web Mail 模块的 URL 日志功能以防止 XSS 载荷被记录并二次触发。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-08/0183.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9905.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5507","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21728","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/ad23a84307831b745d27b34af84abc59130b2cd5/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1434.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bd3fb132c1b8a95ef2bcf26b230a07f7c9700666/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1434.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1434","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1434.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1434.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/3563307faac29cd78316d24dffd5b35b4d38cc65/2002/CVE-2002-1434.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/e3f82cb4abb129ac4e65ce1b058ead82032d2595/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1434.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-14xx/CVE-2002-1434.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1434.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1434.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0586.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0585","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0585.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1432","title":"Midicart ASP - Remote Customer Information Retrieval 漏洞","description":"MidiCart ASP 购物车系统存在敏感信息泄露漏洞。该软件将存储购物车数据的 midicart.mdb 数据库文件直接放置于 Web 根目录下，且未对该文件设置访问控制或权限限制。由于 Web 服务器可被远程访问，任何未授权攻击者只需利用 Web 浏览器或简单工具直接请求该数据库文件的 URL，即可将其完整下载到本地。midicart.mdb 中保存了购物车系统的核心业务数据，包括客户的姓名、地址、联系方式、订单信息以及支付相关等敏感资料，攻击者据此可窃取大量客户隐私信息，进而用于身份冒用、精准钓鱼或金融欺诈等后续攻击。该漏洞攻击条件简单，无需任何认证、可利用性高，属于典型的信息泄露（CWE-200）问题，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级为中危。厂商通过不将敏感数据库置于可被公开访问的目录下并加强访问控制即可有效缓解该风险。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1432"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2003-04-11T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:19Z","remediation":"建议立即将 midicart.mdb 数据库文件移出 Web 根目录（如放到上级目录或 Web 根目录之外空间），并在 Web 服务器（IIS/ASP 目录配置）中显式禁止下载访问 *.mdb/*.asa 等敏感文件类型，同时启用并检查数据库目录连接字符串与新位置保持一致。升级到受支持的 MidiCart 最新安全版本或替换为不含此缺陷的产品版本。此外，关闭 Web 根目录的目录浏览（Directory Browsing）功能，避免攻击者枚举文件路径，并对 Web 服务器执行最小权限且定期备份数据库作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-08/0074.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9816.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5438","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21702","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/ad23a84307831b745d27b34af84abc59130b2cd5/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1432.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1432","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bd3fb132c1b8a95ef2bcf26b230a07f7c9700666/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1432.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1432.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/3563307faac29cd78316d24dffd5b35b4d38cc65/2002/CVE-2002-1432.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1432.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/e3f82cb4abb129ac4e65ce1b058ead82032d2595/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1432.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-14xx/CVE-2002-1432.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1432.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1432.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2002/POC-AVE-2002-0585.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2002/EXP-AVE-2002-0585.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0585.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0584","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0584.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1429","title":"Endity.com ShoutBOX 跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞","description":"Endity.com ShoutBOX 1.2 的 board.php 文件存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向 \"site\" 参数注入精心构造的恶意 HTML 或 JavaScript 代码，将任意内容注入到 shoutbox 页面中执行。该漏洞源于程序未对用户输入进行充分的过滤和转义，攻击者利用此漏洞可在受害者的浏览器中执行任意脚本，导致会话劫持、窃取 Cookie 或进行钓鱼等恶意操作。攻击者无需任何认证即可远程发起攻击，攻击复杂度低，影响该产品 1.2 及更早版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1429"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2003-04-11T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:18Z","remediation":"tags.<value>Endity.com ShoutBOX 已停止维护，无官方补丁，建议将其下线或迁移至仍在维护的替代留言板组件。若必须继续使用，应在 board.php 中对 site 参数及所有回显内容进行严格的 HTML 实体转义（如将 < > \" ' 分别转义为 &lt; &gt; &quot; &#x27;），并对 site 参数进行白名单校验（仅允许 http(s):// 开头的合法域名），同时部署 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）规则拦截包含 <script> 等标签的请求。由于该产品已多年无安全更新，最稳妥的做法是从生产环境彻底移除，或对页面所有用户可控输入统一经过 OWASP ESAPI 等转义库处理后输出。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-07/0389.html","http://endity.com/board/index.php?act=ST&f=3&t=68&s=363128162825b2d7fcf60c9cd2a292fe","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9739.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5354","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21668","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2002/CVE-2002-1429.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/ad23a84307831b745d27b34af84abc59130b2cd5/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1429.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bd3fb132c1b8a95ef2bcf26b230a07f7c9700666/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1429.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1429","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1429.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1429.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/edbeec8f0d16e85a3e6ef588978e47a49091e51a/2002/CVE-2002-1429.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/e3f82cb4abb129ac4e65ce1b058ead82032d2595/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1429.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-14xx/CVE-2002-1429.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1429.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0584.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0583","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0583.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1428","title":"dotProject 身份认证绕过漏洞","description":"` tags.\n\nThe description needs to cover: principle (authentication bypass), impact (dotProject 0.2.1.5), attack conditions (remote, no auth needed).\n\nLet me write a clean ≥50 char Chinese description. Output only the value content.<value>dotProject 0.2.1.5 的 index.php 存在身份认证绕过漏洞。由于程序过度信任客户端提交的认证信息，未在服务端进行可靠的会话校验，攻击者无需真实登录凭据，只需在访问目标的 HTTP 请求 Cookie 或 URL 参数中将 user_cookie 值设置为 1，即可绕过正常认证流程，以授权用户身份访问该受限应用。该漏洞影响 dotProject 0.2.1.x 及更早版本，攻击条件极为简单，任意可访问目标应用的远程攻击者均可利用，无需任何账号或认证，从而实现对系统管理功能与数据的完整访问、篡改，对机密性、完整性和可用性造成严重影响，CVSS 评分 10，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1428"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2003-04-11T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:18Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 dotProject 到不再存在 user_cookie 认证绕过问题的较新版本（该漏洞影响 0.2.1.x 及更早版本，后续已修复）。若无法升级，应删除或禁止用户通过 URL 与 Cookie 传入 user_cookie 参数——在 Web 服务器（Apache/Nginx）层配置访问规则，拦截包含 user_cookie=1 的请求，同时禁止当前仅根据该参数即判定登录状态的源码逻辑。由于产品长期停止维护，强烈建议迁移到仍受支持的项目管理软件，并为该应用设置仅限内网访问、加装 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）和强制强密码等外围缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-07/0366.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9720.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5347","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21661","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/ad23a84307831b745d27b34af84abc59130b2cd5/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1428.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bd3fb132c1b8a95ef2bcf26b230a07f7c9700666/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1428.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1428","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1428.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1428.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/edbeec8f0d16e85a3e6ef588978e47a49091e51a/2002/CVE-2002-1428.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-14xx/CVE-2002-1428.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/353abf5c18895cee7a7860cfcca22d54b4bee560/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1428.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1428.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1428.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0583.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0582","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0582.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1427","title":"Ben Chivers Easy Homepage Creator 未授权文件修改漏洞","description":"Easy Homepage Creator 1.0 中的 edit.cgi 脚本的 print_html_to_file 函数未对用户身份进行认证验证，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可直接利用该漏洞修改其他用户的个人主页内容。该漏洞影响 Easy Homepage Creator 1.0 所有部署版本，攻击者无需任何凭据即可通过发送特制请求篡改目标用户的主页文件，造成页面内容被恶意替换或注入恶意代码。CVSS 评分为 7.5，危害等级为高危。由于该软件为静态网页生成工具，漏洞利用方式简单直接，攻击者可借此在目标服务器上挂载钓鱼页面或传播恶意软件。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1427"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2003-04-11T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:18Z","remediation":"Easy Homepage Creator 1.0 官方已停止维护，未发布针对此漏洞的补丁版本。建议立即停用该软件，并将主页功能迁移至其他维护中的内容管理系统。如暂时无法替换，应在 Web 服务器配置中禁用 edit.cgi 脚本的执行权限，或通过 .htaccess 限制仅允许可信 IP 访问，以阻止远程攻击者利用。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-07/0350.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9696.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5340","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21658","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4cd39de946c4dae2d75d1f265b016c2f29e5b92a/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1427.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4c1d71175e32f1e731b0a7d2c22a87887c3669cd/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1427.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22