1.2.8、1.9.8、2.0.2 及之前版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1423"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2003-04-11T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:18Z","remediation":"升级到 FUDforum 2.2.0 或更高版本，该版本已修复 tmp_view.php 中因未校验 file 参数绝对路径导致的任意文件读取漏洞。对于无法立即升级的实例，可临时禁用或删除 tmp_view.php，并在 Web 服务器层面对其设置访问限制，同时检查并清理服务器上可能已遭泄漏的敏感配置文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/vulnwatch/2002-q3/0082.html","http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/288042","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9896.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5501","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21723","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d3cd9ba427c33ce366db05d18df45d3a792f5f74/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1423.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4c1d71175e32f1e731b0a7d2c22a87887c3669cd/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1423.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1423","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1423.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1423.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/feb3588b82c9620d09c69f65c4fe01c2dcf3dd03/2002/CVE-2002-1423.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/353abf5c18895cee7a7860cfcca22d54b4bee560/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1423.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-14xx/CVE-2002-1423.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/6bb18b34820034d354785c1f34bbb7285e8899e0/tracker/CVE/2002/CVE-2002-1423.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1423.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0580.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0579","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0579.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1422","title":"FUDforum admbrowse.php 任意文件创建删除漏洞","description":"FUDforum 论坛软件的 admbrowse.php 脚本存在文件修改漏洞，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过在 cur 和 dest 参数中传递 URL 编码的文件路径，在服务器上创建或删除任意文件。该漏洞影响 FUDforum 1.2.8、1.9.8、2.0.2 及更早版本，攻击者仅需向目标系统发送特制的 HTTP 请求即可利用，无需账号凭据或复杂的交互条件，成功利用可导致网站文件被篡改或删除，进而影响论坛正常运行。建议升级至 FUDforum 2.2.0 或更高版本以修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1422"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2003-04-11T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:17Z","remediation":"立即升级到FUDforum 2.2.0或更高版本，应用官方安全补丁；如无法立即升级，可通过.htaccess文件禁用admbrowse.php功能，并限制用户在web根目录之外的写入权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/vulnwatch/2002-q3/0082.html","http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/288042","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9901.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5502","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21724","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d3cd9ba427c33ce366db05d18df45d3a792f5f74/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1422.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1cf21dc2c185a3301ffa683a942c44c61b3a4b1e/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1422.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1422","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1422.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1422.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/726a223a23a749274833ae3776326ca97dd305d1/2002/CVE-2002-1422.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/353abf5c18895cee7a7860cfcca22d54b4bee560/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1422.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-14xx/CVE-2002-1422.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/6bb18b34820034d354785c1f34bbb7285e8899e0/tracker/CVE/2002/CVE-2002-1422.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1422.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0579.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0578","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0578.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1414","title":"qmail qmailadmin 本地缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"qmailadmin 1.0.x 版本存在本地缓冲区溢出漏洞。qmailadmin 在处理 QMAILADMIN_TEMPLATEDIR 环境变量时未对输入长度进行有效边界校验，导致缓冲区溢出。本地攻击者可通过设置一个超长的 QMAILADMIN_TEMPLATEDIR 环境变量并运行 qmailadmin 来利用该漏洞，从而提升系统权限，可能获得对邮件系统的未授权控制并执行任意代码。该漏洞影响所有部署 qmailadmin 1.0.x 版本的 qmail 邮件系统，攻击条件为攻击者已具有目标系统的本地访问权限，利用方式为通过环境变量注入触发缓冲区溢出以提权。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1414"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2003-04-11T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:17Z","remediation":"立即将 qmailadmin 升级至 1.0.6 或更高版本，该版本对 QMAILADMIN_TEMPLATEDIR 环境变量的长度进行了边界检查，修复了缓冲区溢出问题。如暂时无法升级，可执行以下缓解措施：取消 qmailadmin 的 setuid 位（chmod u-s /usr/local/www/cgi-bin.default/qmailadmin/qmailadmin），并在 Web 服务器（如 Apache）的配置中清理或限制 QMAILADMIN_TEMPLATEDIR 环境变量，阻止本地用户通过超长路径触发溢出提权。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-08/0016.html","http://marc.info/?l=vuln-dev&m=102859603029424&w=2","http://www.inter7.com/qmailadmin/ChangeLog","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9786.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5404","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21683","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/dfd3785ea0ca532d9efd1c0b17520a18e47b035b/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1414.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1414","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/b