les.php?op=modload&name=News&file=article&sid=50&mode=thread&order=0&thold=0","http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-138","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5375","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/9737","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21676","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1e49eca35d3056672c77df905c5c125f371b8ebb/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1412.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1412","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1cf21dc2c185a3301ffa683a942c44c61b3a4b1e/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1412.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1412.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1412.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/a121c9678feb15c776e19eb9a2198be3c8093209/2002/CVE-2002-1412.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/a34babb9031dd723054cf90c4f7fb7c79c3ea176/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1412.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-14xx/CVE-2002-1412.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/6bb18b34820034d354785c1f34bbb7285e8899e0/tracker/CVE/2002/CVE-2002-1412.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1412.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0577.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0576","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0576.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1410","title":"Ben Chivers Easy Guestbook 未授权管理访问漏洞","description":"Easy Guestbook 1.0 的 CGI 程序未对管理员操作进行身份认证，未经身份验证的远程攻击者可通过直接访问 admin.cgi 删除留言板条目，或通过直接访问 config.cgi 重新配置留言板设置。该漏洞影响 Ben Chivers Easy Guestbook 1.0 版本，攻击者无需任何凭据即可在远程获取对留言板管理功能的未授权访问权限，可能导致数据被篡改、删除或配置被恶意修改，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1410"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2003-04-11T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:16Z","remediation":"该软件为 Ben Chivers Easy Guestbook 1.0，已停止维护且无官方补丁。建议立即升级到现代化的留言板系统（如 PHP Guestbook、Drupal 留言模块等），或彻底删除 Easy Guestbook 的 admin.cgi 与 config.cgi 文件。若短期内无法替换，应在 Web 服务器配置中通过 .htaccess 或防火墙规则限制对 admin.cgi 和 config.cgi 的访问来源 IP，仅允许可信地址访问，并重启 Web 服务使配置生效。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-07/0356.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9697.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5341","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21659","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1e49eca35d3056672c77df905c5c125f371b8ebb/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1410.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2e34647e2cb70f634f637d7ffe35fe3375a62e16/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1410.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1410","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1410.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1410.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/ce2c8661ffd3fb6a28ed59c3d877961640a570d4/2002/CVE-2002-1410.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/a34babb9031dd723054cf90c4f7fb7c79c3ea176/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1410.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-14xx/CVE-2002-1410.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1410.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1410.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2002/POC-AVE-2002-0576.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0576.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0545","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0545.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1143","title":"Microsoft Word 和 Excel 域代码信息泄露漏洞","description":"Microsoft Word 95/97/98/2000/2002 及 Excel 2002 在处理文档域代码时存在信息泄露漏洞。远程攻击者可构造特制 Office 文档，利用 INCLUDETEXT 或 INCLUDEPICTURE 等域代码在文档返回给攻击者时自动插入并泄露目标系统中的敏感信息（如文件内容）。用户只需打开恶意文档即可触发，无需额外认证，攻击者可通过社会工程诱导用户打开文档实现信息窃取。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1143"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2003-04-11T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:48Z","remediation":"升级到 Microsoft Office XP SP2 或更高版本，该漏洞已在 MS02-031 安全公告中修复。对于无法升级的旧版 Office（Word 95/97/98/2000/2002、Excel 2002），建议禁用文档中的域代码自动执行功能：在 Word 中依次点击「工具」→「选项」→「安全性」→勾选「打开文档时更新自动链接」，或通过组策略禁用 INCLUDETEXT/INCLUDEPICTURE 域代码。同时避免打开来自不可信来源的 Office 文档。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=103040003014999&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=103252858816401&w=2","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/10008.php","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/10155.php","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/899713","http://www.microsoft.com/technet/treeview/default.asp?url=/Technet/security/topics/secword.asp","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5586","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5764","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2002/ms02-059","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A202","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21764","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2002/CVE-2002-1143.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7db8931ea0378982e66f435e269a4ed0e4efb7aa/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1143.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2002/CVE-2002-1143.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2002/CVE-2002-1143.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1143","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f80eaead111eac7128eaf77e46b372cdbd675cc9/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1143.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2002/CVE-2002-1143.md","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2002/CVE-2002-1143.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1143.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/e2cba2a029d0a53c95f0000f5eb42e0eb69717b8/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1143.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0545.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0094","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0094.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1425","title":"mpack munpack 目录遍历漏洞","description":"mpack 1.5 及更早版本中的 munpack 工具存在目录遍历漏洞，远程攻击者可通过在待解压文件的文件名中插入 ../（点点斜杠）序列，绕过路径限制，在父目录中创建新文件。攻击者无需身份认证即可利用此漏洞，可能导致任意文件写入，进而结合其他漏洞实现远程代码执行或系统控制。该漏洞影响 mpack 1.5 及之前所有版本，CVSS 评分 6.4，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.4,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1425"],"sources":["osv"],"published":"2003-04-11T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:18Z","remediation":"升级 mpack 至 1.6 或更高版本，该版本修复了 munpack 对 ../ 序列的路径过滤不严问题。如无法升级，可限制 mpack 处理用户上传文件时的解压目录权限，或使用 AppArmor/SELinux 策略限制 munpack 的文件写入范围。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-141","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9748.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5386","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58bdedd85e346c3efc30a2f8424c96c50aa4db2e/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1425.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee360